--- 
Title: Bloomin' Bread
Servings: 8
Tags: Sidekicks, Bread, Prosciutto, Parsley, Cheese, Onion, Oil
Link: https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/13795/calico-beans/
---

Set oven to 370F

Cut @Bread{1} surface imto square design

Whisk @Oil{3 Tablespoons}, minced @Garlic{5 Tablespoons} & @Onion{5 Tablespoons} in a #small bowl{}

Slice @Prosciutto

Apply the Oil Paste to top of crevasses of th Bread while stuffing in Prosciutto and @Cheese{2 cups}

Bake for ~{15 minutes}

Garnish with @Parsley